#: admin/src/components/steps/Step4Recommendations.tsx:21
msgid "Campaign Intelligence uses your store’s product, customer and order data to create personalised product recommendations for Smaily campaigns and automations. This helps you send more relevant emails with less manual work."
msgstr "Campaign Intelligence kasutab sinu poe toote-, kliendi- ja tellimuseandmeid, et luua Smaily kampaaniate ja automaatikate jaoks personaalseid tootesoovitusi. Nii saad saata asjakohasemaid kirju vähema käsitööga."

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step4Recommendations.tsx:25
msgid "Campaign Intelligence is an optional paid add-on (€250/month), added to your regular Smaily monthly payment. Contact Smaily to activate it, or set it up later."
msgstr "Campaign Intelligence on valikuline tasuline lisateenus (250 €/kuus), mis lisandub sinu tavapärasele Smaily kuumaksele. Aktiveerimiseks võta Smailyga ühendust või seadista see hiljem."

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step4Recommendations.tsx:34
msgid "Engine connected — now wire up the Campaign Intelligence automation workflows"
msgstr "Mootor ühendatud — nüüd seo Campaign Intelligence’i automaatikad"

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step4Recommendations.tsx:45
msgid "Replenishment and win-back automations are configured in Step 3 (Automated letters), below the store-run triggers."
msgstr "Taastäite- ja tagasivõitmise automaatikad seadistatakse 3. sammus („Automaatikad“), poe-poolsete päästikute all."

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step4Recommendations.tsx:85
msgid "Copy the Campaign Intelligence connection URL in the following field and click on Connect to activate the connection."
msgstr "Kleebi Smaily Campaign Intelligence’i ühenduse URL allolevasse lahtrisse ja kliki Ühenda nupule."

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step5Integrations.tsx:88
msgid "Add a newsletter signup form to your page using any of these methods."
msgstr "Lisa oma kodulehele uudiskirjaga liitumise vorm alljärgnevate meetodite abil."

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step5Integrations.tsx:140
msgid "Forms and RSS feed"
msgstr "Vormid ja RSS"

#: admin/src/components/steps/Step5Integrations.tsx:141
msgid "Add a newsletter subscription form to any page, to collect new subscribers directly to your Smaily account. Choose the suitable form option for your page and follow the instructions to add the form."
msgstr "Lisa uudiskirjaga liitumise Smaily vorm oma lehele. Vali all järgnevate variantide seast sobiv ning kliki „Ava …“ nupule vormi seadistamiseks."

