#: admin/src/components/steps/TransactionalEmailsSection.tsx:33
msgid "Create a connection with your transactional Smaily account to send order confirmations and shipping notifications. Contact Smaily support (support@smaily.com) to set up your transactional Smaily account."
msgstr "Loo ühendus oma tehinguliste kirjade Smaily kontoga ja saada ostujärgseid kinnitus- ning tarnekirju oma klientidele. Võta ühendust Smaily klienditoega (support@smaily.com) tehingulise konto seadistamiseks."

#: admin/src/components/steps/TransactionalEmailsSection.tsx:44
