msgstr "Saada tehingulisi kirju"

#: admin/src/components/steps/TransactionalEmailsSection.tsx:68
msgid "Once the connection has been made, set up order and shipping confirmations under Automations setup step."
msgstr "Kui ühendus on loodud, saad seadistada automaatsed kirjad kolmandas sammus „Automaatikad“ seadistuse lehel."

#: admin/src/components/steps/TransactionalTriggersSection.tsx:16
msgid "Send transactional emails via transactional Smaily account, which you can connect in the first setup step. Transactional emails should be sent from a separate account than marketing emails."
msgstr "Saada tehingulisi kirju läbi tehinguliste kirjade Smaily konto, millega ühenduse saad luua esimeses sammus. Tehingulised kirjad tuleks saata turunduskirjade kontost eraldi."

#: admin/src/components/steps/TransactionalTriggersSection.tsx:41
msgid "Sent when the order has been completed and is ready to be sent."
msgstr "Saadetakse, kui tellimus on poe poolelt valmis ning pannakse teele."

