#: includes/Notifications/NotificationManager.php:494
msgid "Smaily Connect: Smaily is refusing every request because this account's package does not include API access. Contact sync and email automations stay stopped until the account is on a package that includes it — waiting will not restore them, and the credentials cannot be checked until then."
msgstr "Smaily Connect: Smaily keeldub igast päringust, sest selle konto pakett ei sisalda API-ligipääsu. Kontaktide sünkroonimine ja e-posti automatiseeringud jäävad seisma, kuni konto on paketil, mis API-t sisaldab — ootamine neid ei taasta ja kontoandmeid ei saa enne seda kontrollida."

#: includes/Notifications/NotificationManager.php:501
msgid "Smaily Connect: Smaily is rejecting the saved API credentials, so contact sync and email automations have stopped. Check the subdomain, API username and password under Settings → Connection."
msgstr "Smaily Connect: Smaily lükkab salvestatud API-sisselogimisandmed tagasi, mistõttu kontaktide sünkroonimine ja e-posti automatiseeringud on seiskunud. Kontrolli alamdomeeni, API-kasutajanime ja parooli jaotises Settings → Connection."

#: includes/REST/TestConnectionEndpoint.php:155
msgid "Smaily refused the request because this account's package does not include API access. Upgrade the package in Smaily to connect — until then the credentials cannot be checked at all."
msgstr "Smaily keeldus päringust, sest selle konto pakett ei sisalda API-ligipääsu. Ühendamiseks uuenda Smailys paketti — enne seda ei saa sisselogimisandmeid üldse kontrollida."

#: includes/REST/TestConnectionEndpoint.php:162
msgid "Smaily could not be reached. This looks temporary — try again in a moment."
msgstr "Smailyni ei jõudnud. See tundub ajutine — proovi hetke pärast uuesti."

#: admin/src/components/steps/CredentialBlock.tsx:108
msgid "Leave empty to keep using the stored password."
msgstr "Jäta tühjaks, et kasutada salvestatud parooli."
